 23  | [ П→x ] [ 1 ]            | Load register into X
 24  | [ 1 ]                    | Load numeric constant into X
 25  | [ В↑ ]                   | Push X to Y (Enter)
 26  | [ + ]                    | X = Y + X
 27  | [ В/О ]                  | Return from subroutine
